- Files will be sorted alpha numericly based on file namne on the navigation page
- Use number prefixes to sort, i.e. "01-first-file.md, 02-second-file.md, etc..."
- Use valid markdown formatting
- Login to this host
- Create a new or copy your .md file into \`/opt/caddy-markdown/srv\` directory
